---
import { affiliateLinks } from "../../../data/affiliateLinks";
---

<section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-16">

<div class="rounded-3xl border-2 border-green-500 bg-green-50 p-10">

<h2 class="text-4xl font-bold">
🏆 Why We Recommend Canva AI
</h2>

<p class="mt-8 text-lg leading-8 text-gray-700">

Canva AI is one of the easiest and most complete AI design platforms
available today.

Instead of paying for multiple AI tools, Canva combines design,
AI writing, image generation, presentations, collaboration
and marketing assets inside one subscription.

</p>

<a

href={affiliateLinks.canva}

target="_blank"

rel="nofollow sponsored noopener"

onclick="trackAffiliateClick('Canva AI','Recommendation Box')"

class="mt-10 inline-flex rounded-2xl bg-green-600 px-8 py-4 font-bold text-white hover:bg-green-700"

>

🎉 Claim 50% OFF

</a>

</div>

</section>